cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software itself and the preferred citation below."
title: "gunfolds: Tools for causal graphs under undersampling and latent variables"
abstract: >
  gunfolds is a Python package for working with compressed graphs and for solving
  the forward and inverse problems that arise when time series are undersampled or
  contain latent variables. It provides implementations of MSL, RASL, and dRASL,
  along with ASP-based (Answer Set Programming, via clingo) and CSP-based solvers,
  and utilities for simulating, converting, and visualizing dynamic causal graphs.
